msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1589 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2407
msgid "Let members choose their own username"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1590 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2408
msgid ""
"Off by default: a username is generated from their email so nobody has to "
